  "ai.orion81Completely": "<0>Orion-81 oshilongo shi shi ya ningwa ayihe kAI.<\/0> Oshimpa kehe shooode yaOrion-81 yene osha shangwa na Claude Code, ya yelekwa komutameki. Oshikepe kehe, ekarata, etekisitura neendo olya ningwa kiilongitho ya shangwa kuClaude Code. Omutameki oha tokola shoka tashi ningwa; Claude Code oha tala ngaashi tashi ningwa. Omabaliha gokaalaka ngoka ga longithwa oga tumbulwa pevi 'Ihe ya ningwa kAI'. Oshinima shimwe natango osha kala ohi shi ulikwa pehala lya yela: <1>ekonakono lyelaisensa<\/1> lyooode yoshiigwana sha za kokuyelekwa kwa GPL.",
  "ai.orionBegan28": "Orion oya tameke mosiku 28 Septemba 2026 ngaashi efaneko lyotango pa njini yoshiigwana Quake III Arena (GPL), noshikepe yaElite Dangerous ngaashi omupondolo. Mosiku etiyali ooode yoshiigwana oya yi pa BuB, enjini epe ya shangwa na Claude Code; omamodule goshiigwana oga za kefaneko lyotango, nokonima oga tumbulwa lyo edhina epe. Efaneko 0.3.0 olya pa iikepe aveshe 16 omikalo dhawo epe. Ekonakono lyoluvalo olya tala kutya ooode otaa kala oya za koshiigwana sha GPL, nutya iikepe yotango otayi yelekana noshipondolo. Okuyelekana kwooode nongushu ya GPL okwa ningwa mosiku 8 Oktoba 2026, ndele ekonakono lyomaiyuvo gokuyelekana otali kalelwa. Shoka sha za koshiigwana otashi ka shangwa lyo nenge shi yelekwe lyo.",
