  "d.109szp9": "Evi lyoshili nenge omaukwatya ga kwata ngoka tu wapaleke.",
  "d.10azxrl": "Omapandja ndatu goshiwana shoshuni pombanda yoshuni. Ombwiha olwoyo: engala lyoshikepe, okometa, nooolwoodhi dhinene. Omuliko otau ya kehe oomiti ontiti.",
  "d.10wlatv": "Ombala ya ihogololelwa ye na omukalo gwa yela pevi lya 0x40 otai lesha ngaashi STOCK, onkee engala kali kala lyo li hole okumonika.",
  "d.11cuwtu": "OMAROKETI",
  "d.11jyj1n": "Omuhanaguli e na oregan yomasipina yokati nomunazo gwomaleisa nomatanga gomaroketi omulongo notano nolimwe.",
  "d.11phsqq": "Omupatululi gwoshiigwana ngoka ha taambula oshigwana sha ningwa 100% kAI ohe shi patulula.",
  "d.11zjijr": "Iilwifo otayi dulu okulikwa nokuholekwa (iilwifo ya holekwa oya holekwa), noikepe kayi na lyo omwiyu.",
  "d.11zq7hg": "Okutala: omahala gokukala ge na ouyelele woshili, oontanga dha tulwa momikalo, egasi lyoplaneta neringi, elaka lyoontanga nelaka lyomaulu, omwiyu gwenjini nomuliko gokulongeka; okuuda kwokulonga kwa 0.1.0 okwa kwatwa.",
  "d.12zyt91": "ANVIL, efano lyohangara okuza momenyu yoshiigwana (olwoodhi ngaashi lwa ningwa 0.3.0 nokonima; oshiwana shoshili 256 x 128). Efano lyomoshiigwana, efaneko 0.6.1",
  "d.13cb0px": "Aakuyuuvi pombanda yoshilongo, nomiwiyu dhenjini (GLASGOW). Efano lyomoshiigwana, efaneko 0.5.3",
  "d.1436q76": "Efaneko 0.5.1 lya hangwa: iitaala yehala lyoshilwifo, omatandi gomaroketi gatano na limwe, nehala lya ANVIL tali tula 10 NEEDLE.",
  "d.14s5uo6": "Omiwiyu dhenjini pokweshikepe shiyuuluwo nopomulwi. Efano lyomoshiigwana, efaneko 0.5.3",
  "d.14vqvyw": "ANVIL nohangara yayo ya yapulwa. Efano lyomoshiigwana, efaneko 0.6.1",
  "d.14zbb1f": "Omulwi omugoshi ta dhengwa kongundu yaakuyuuvi mehala lyomamanya lya THETA-7, oshiwilu shengala lyuye tashi yela.",
  "d.15oh132": "omafaneko ga hangwa",
  "d.16dme8w": "Omaleisa ga kwatwa otaga hangana kehala limwe lyokutsa komeho yoshikepe.",
  "d.16sui9e": "Oshikepe shomukuluntu shoshiwana shoshilongo, e na ehala lyokukala lya hondola, omaregan gomasipina gamba gomabali, nomagan ogendji ngaashi oshikungo.",
  "d.177y6xj": "Okukunka kwa pamba kwomabali.",
