  "d.1u1n685": "WARHOUND ngaashi tashi monika momenyu yohangara yoshiigwana, olwoodhi lwa 0.6.1, okutala kwoshitopolwa shatatu pombunda.",
  "d.1uzcurt": "Oshikepe shoilonga ya Orion Defense Initiative: omaleisa ane, ogan yokooshiyaa yoshigoshi neharo lyomaroketi gatano nalimwe.",
