  "d.1xeup9p": "Ekonakono lyelaisensa natango ola kala po: okuyelekana kwooode nongushu ya GPL okwa ningwa mosiku {date0}, ndele ekonakono lyomaiyuvo gokuyelekana otali kalelwa.",
  "d.1xktp85": "KORVETA YOKUDHENGA",
