  "d.1ysusgc": "Ngaashi iikepe ya futwa tayi kala ya yuka mokulwa kwaakuyuuvi yaaivali natango otaku pangelwa.",
  "d.21ryis": "Omatseyitho ga ATTACK otaga yaluka pokati koshimbo shimwe nesho shi li pokuvanda.",
  "d.2pbr86": "Pokati",
  "d.2r8k8j": "EPEPO LYOMBANDA",
  "d.2sqinp": "Iikepe ndatu nomiwiyu dhenjini pombanda yaGlasgow ya hiti, tayi vundithwa koshikepe shomuvundi komeho.",
  "d.2vomdh": "Okuyelekana kwooode yoshiigwana nongushu ya GPL okwa ningwa mosiku {date0}. Ekonakono lyomaiyuvo gokuyelekana otali kalelwa. Shoka sha monika sha kopwa nenge sha yeluthwa otashi ka shangwa lyo.",
  "d.32ogvm": "Omiwiyu dhenjini dha tengwa okuza kokanyango, ANVIL ye 240 m ne ohangara ya yela nomivelo, NEEDLE dha tuluka okuza kooyi mbali, ATTACK yoshimbo shimwe nenge sho shi li pokuvanda, na ANVIL dha AI tadhi tuluka iikepe yadho.",
  "d.3b0pca": "OMUKONAKONI",
  "d.3bxw4p": "Elongo lyotango lyokuyongolola ookula dhaveshe.",
  "d.3ednu": "Okushanga lyo konima okuza kenjini ya AI-BuB fiyo Unreal Engine 5",
  "d.3m3q6c": "Oshuni nomuliko, omuliko otau ya kehe oomiti ontiti.",
  "d.3wpyge": "Omakilometa omulongo notano nolimwe goshilongo pOmulonga gwaClyde pevi lyombanda ya gwena. Ouyuki woshili, epepo lyoshili, omatilo nomakrain: kala wa kunka noshiyuuluwo shoye kashi pite pomulonga.",
  "d.4b5t91": "PERIHELION, 4 SOLAR RADII, efano lyehala okuza momenyu yoshiigwana. Efano lyomoshiigwana, efaneko 0.6.1",
  "d.4p55jj": "omihoko dhiikepe",
  "d.4pqks5": "Ooode yoshiigwana otayi yi pa BuB, enjini epe ya shangwa na Claude Code. Omamodule goshiigwana otaga za kefaneko lyotango, nokonima otaga tumbulwa lyo edhina epe.",
  "d.4wz1ss": "Oshimpwiyu LOADOUT manga ehe li eteko kehe (omuvundi gumwe nolobi yaavundi ayihe) nomalongo golwoodhi nengala, ombala yengala, omalolo gehala lyoshilwifo kehe niikepe yohangara ya ANVIL.",
  "d.5h9ajx": "OMALEISA",
  "d.5zdnfb": "Kape na epepo: kape na okukwatwa.",
  "d.61r5q7": "OHANGARA NA NEEDLE 10",
  "d.6mw8fz": "Omikunda domunazo gomaleisa negan ngoka ge tameke pa AUTO.",
  "d.6vf32z": "Efaneko 0 (okuulika) lya hangwa: iikepe 8, iilwifo yoluvalo, noshishangwa shomatandi, ehala lyomamanya THETA-7.",
  "d.6wbq2y": "Eyoyo lyoshuni, efano limwe lyomutalatali gwiikarata.",
  "d.709qra": "Kwata opo u yadhithe, etha opo u tse. Okuetha pe yadhitha 50 % nenge shindji okutsa; ngele pe li pevi okwa yalulwa.",
  "d.7a27ds": "Omataya gomahala goshilwifo, omatanga gomaroketi gatano nalimwe nokamera tai landula, okukunka kwa pamba kwomabali, omaleisa gomaripple ga ANVIL, ohangara ya ANVIL tai tuluka NEEDLE 10 dhomukwanyoka, nomwaalu gwokunyenyeta kwokamera.",
  "d.7xvt5u": "Aveshe otayi ningwa kAI penjini ya BuB, ta longitha Claude Code.",
  "d.87vl1g": "Okulonga pamwe mombaliha yepuka (hanga omatengo pa Wi-Fi yimwe, kala nenge yi mo molobi, tameka pamwe; omatanga gokulonga pamwe nomatengo gaveshe) niikarata ine epe ndatu: LUNA, EARTH ORBIT na SOL.",
  "d.899luq": "THRESHER ngaashi tashi monika momenyu yohangara yoshiigwana, olwoodhi lwa 0.6.1, okutala kwoshitopolwa shatatu pombunda.",
  "d.90i5d3": "Epepo lyombanda.",
  "d.99x268": "PATHFINDER ngaashi tashi monika momenyu yohangara yoshiigwana, olwoodhi lwa 0.6.1, okutala kwoshitopolwa shatatu pombunda.",
