  "d.io5wt3": "LEVIATHAN ngaashi tashi monika momenyu yohangara yoshiigwana, olwoodhi lwa 0.6.1, okutala kwoshitopolwa shatatu pombunda.",
  "d.ivii1": "FRIGATA YOKUKWATHELA",
  "d.j729g1": "Eyoyo lyoshuni li li 29 degrees, lya yukila pevi.",
  "d.k474fg": "Iigoshi",
  "d.kddlvb": "Omukila gwaregan otagu kala konima yomudhengo. Efano lyomoshiigwana, efaneko 0.6.1",
  "d.kg7xsi": "Omatanga gomaroketi, efano limwe lyelaboratori yiilwifo.",
  "d.khkezi": "Omulwi, oshiwilu shengala lyuye tashi yela, pokati komamanya ga THETA-7. Efano lyomoshiigwana, efaneko 0.6.1",
  "d.l1nhkh": "Ekumaido lyomaroketi taga ya nomatanga. Efano lyomoshiigwana, efaneko 0.5.2",
  "d.lfm0mz": "Oshikepe shiinima ondji shi ngaashi oshitopolwa shoshilongo. Omunazo nokutsa kwomaroketi, kape na oshikaha tashi dulu okutumbulwa.",
  "d.lomr5e": "RAMPART, efano lyohangara okuza momenyu yoshiigwana (olwoodhi ngaashi lwa ningwa 0.3.0 nokonima; oshiwana shoshili 256 x 128). Efano lyomoshiigwana, efaneko 0.6.1",
  "d.m3odu3": "Oshimaliko shomagan shombanda: ogan yimwe onene kombunda, omapari gomaleisa, omunazo gamabali ngoka u ya longitha yene, neregan yomasipina yoshigoshi.",
  "d.mmkrqn": "Ya shunithwa pa BuB nokutumbulwa lyo edhina. Okuyelekana kwooode nongushu yefaneko lyotango okwa ningwa mosiku {date0}; ekonakono lyomaiyuvo gokuyelekana otali kalelwa",
  "d.mubbp2": "PATHFINDER, efano lyohangara okuza momenyu yoshiigwana (olwoodhi ngaashi lwa ningwa 0.3.0 nokonima; oshiwana shoshili 256 x 128). Efano lyomoshiigwana, efaneko 0.6.1",
  "d.mujtj0": "Oshikepe shokulwa shiyuuluwo: oshilongo shoshikaha, oregan yomasipina onene nomunazo gomaregan gane momapari ga ningwa pombanda.",
  "d.nrv8s2": "Omaregan gomasipina omatenga pamwe niikepe iinene fiyo.",
  "d.nuhm57": "Omihoko hetatu dhiikepe, omaleisa nokutsa kwomatanga, nehala lyomamanya lya THETA-7.",
  "d.p1uh6f": "Efaneko lyotango otali tameke pa njini yoshiigwana Quake III Arena (GPL), noshikepe yaElite Dangerous ngaashi omupondolo.",
  "d.pimdbg": "Efaneko 0.4.0 lya hangwa: okutala kwoshili: ouyelele wefano, omuyelele ga kaleko, ehundo lyongala lya nyenye.",
  "d.pp01v0": "NEEDLE ngaashi tashi monika momenyu yohangara yoshiigwana, olwoodhi lwa 0.6.1, okutala kwoshitopolwa shatatu pombunda.",
  "d.qwk107": "Omamanya otaga zunguka nokuwa; ogo ge li gonene kage dulu okuyonagulwa nandi.",
  "d.r70f4w": "THETA-7 nombanda nomamanya gwa 0.5.0. Efano lyomoshiigwana, efaneko 0.5.0",
  "d.rap4k0": "BRAWLER, efano lyohangara okuza momenyu yoshiigwana (olwoodhi ngaashi lwa ningwa 0.3.0 nokonima; oshiwana shoshili 256 x 128). Efano lyomoshiigwana, efaneko 0.6.1",
  "d.reost1": "Omulwi ta ikwatha engala ta tsa eleisa koshimbo shoshikesha.",
  "d.rexwmq": "Kwata oshitsi opo u tse. Oongundu dhokutsa dhoshikepe otadhi landulathana pomuthika kehe gwokutsa lyo, noshigan kehe shokwatwa nomunazo gomaleisa mongundu ndjoka otashi tsa.",
  "d.sdtkzv": "Oshimpwiyu LOADOUT shaORION-1 nomalongo golwoodhi nengala, ombala yengala nomalolo gomahala goshilwifo.",
  "d.sp0f4k": "Otashi pe omalongo 3 gengala (STANDARD EMITTER, HARDENED EMITTER, DEEP-FIELD EMITTER).",
  "d.sudba1": "OKUTSA OMAROKETI",
  "d.svcsep": "Ouyuki 1.62 m/s2 (0.165 g).",
  "d.taax41": "Elogo lyaOrion-81: oontanga ndatu dhi yela dha buluu-wa wela mepitola lya silfa lya yoongwa.",
  "d.tbfe8v": "Omakeepo ga tulwa, omabuku gomafano ga ningwa.",
  "d.tg0hgk": "Omamanya ga yoongelwa ne omayuvo gehala lyomamanya lya THETA-7.",
  "d.tg8bac": "MERIDIAN ngaashi tashi monika momenyu yohangara yoshiigwana, olwoodhi lwa 0.6.1, okutala kwoshitopolwa shatatu pombunda.",
  "d.tg8pdz": "Otashi pe ombala 8 dhengala, nombala ya ihogololelwa.",
  "d.th2bvi": "Iitopolwa, momukalo: L1, id yomuhoko, ehokololo lyolwoodhi + ehokololo lyengala, ombala, omayeleko gehala lyoshilwifo, id yoshikepe, ehokololo lyolwoodhi lwoshikepe + ehokololo lyengala lyoshikepe, omayeleko gomahala goshilwifo shoshikepe. Ombala oya shangwa '-' pa STOCK, 'p<k>' pehala k lyepaleta, nenge omahokololo gantano na limwe ge hex gomakwatha. Epitola olya kala stock ngele li li '00' (omalongo), '-' (ombala, oshikepe) nenge li hwile (omahala goshilwifo); epitola kehe lya stock konima yepitola lyahugunina lya hahe stock olya tuwa po, dhotango odha kala. Iitopolwa yoshikepe oya po ashike pomuhoko gwe na ohangara. Ehogolo ndyoka omuhoko kagu dulu okutwala otali lesha ngaashi STOCK.",
  "d.tjh47s": "Oshitsa otashi londa nokutsa kwongundu kehe; omagan otaga hwa nokutsa ngele a gwana oshimbo, ndele ta shunuka ngele e li pevi lyoshimbo shi li pevi.",
  "d.tnqgr2": "Ooode yoshiigwana ya shunithwa okuza kefaneko lyotango lya GPL",
  "d.tqhusf": "Omagan ga kwatwa otaga tsa kehala lyokuhangana lyomuhoko; omunazo otaga tsa kehala lyomutse gwoshimbo meyi lyago.",
  "d.uq3bbi": "OMAREGAN",
  "d.v0hnua": "Ya ningwa taatate ngoka kaa na ethimbo lyokukala ngaashi aanona ya li ya hala.",
  "d.va88ub": "Efaneko 0.1.0 lya hangwa: okutala kwoshili kwa sayensi yepuya, omaroketi nomaregan, iikepe 16 okuza kwe 12 m fiyo 1.2 km, ekarata lya Glasgow.",
  "d.vktsja": "OMUHANAGULI",
  "d.vway3": "Kwata oshitsi shomaroketi opo u tse okambonda. Oshitulukilo otashi tsa shimwe shimwe, nomagazini aveshe otai yadhwa lyo ngele i hwa.",
  "d.w9u9l8": "Otu na okuuva omapumbwa aveshe gopashipango gokupatulula oshiigwana sha ningwa 100% kAI.",
  "d.wqqgrq": "Okutsa omaroketi otaku ikalela: omunazo gwaPD otagu tsa omaroketi gaakuyuuvi pomutse gwa 1.5 km, noku tsa ihe li pomutsi.",
  "d.x2k8or": "Enjini e na ehala lyokukala la tulwa po. Omaleisa gamabali, omagan gamabali pomulundu gwomapepe nolwoodhi olwa kunka mehala: dhenga, tsa po nokuudhula, tsa lyo.",
  "d.xd9o89": "OMUKWATI GWOILONGA ONDJI",
  "d.xee72g": "ORION-1, efano lyohangara okuza momenyu yoshiigwana (olwoodhi ngaashi lwa ningwa 0.3.0 nokonima; oshiwana shoshili 256 x 128). Efano lyomoshiigwana, efaneko 0.6.1",
  "d.xnwaaf": "Ehala lyoshiwana lya enda nomukunda gwokunyenyeta pamwe nelongo lya 8 km.",
  "d.xtzt3d": "Efaneko 0.5.3 lya hangwa: ANVIL ye 240 m ye na ehala ewanawa lyokutala nomalwifo ga NEEDLE okuza kooyi mbali.",
  "d.xus0g5": "Omunazo gomaleisa negan otaga dulu okutulwa kehe pa MANUAL nenge AUTO.",
  "d.y0cdyl": "Omaregan ga kwatwa, omunazo gomagan na CIWS oya yaluka muhoko gumwe gwomagan; omunazo na CIWS otaga longitha omagazini gumwe gwomunazo.",
  "d.y22qv5": "IRONCLAD, efano lyohangara okuza momenyu yoshiigwana (olwoodhi ngaashi lwa ningwa 0.3.0 nokonima; oshiwana shoshili 256 x 128). Efano lyomoshiigwana, efaneko 0.6.1",
  "d.yabbmd": "CARAVAN, efano lyohangara okuza momenyu yoshiigwana (olwoodhi ngaashi lwa ningwa 0.3.0 nokonima; oshiwana shoshili 256 x 128). Efano lyomoshiigwana, efaneko 0.6.1",
  "d.ygdahp": "Efaneko 0.6.1 lya hangwa: ANVIL dhomuvundi dha AI tadhi tula iikepe yadho, noshikepe tayi shuna mehala.",
  "d.ygdciu": "Omatengo ge LAN gaveshe",
  "d.ykoysr": "KESTREL ngaashi tashi monika momenyu yohangara yoshiigwana, olwoodhi lwa 0.6.1, okutala kwoshitopolwa shatatu pombunda.",
  "d.yz0shp": "Iikepe iiyuuluwo fiyo 351.4 m (ouwa wa BASTION) otayi vulu okuvunda mpaka.",
  "d.yzucb5": "IRONCLAD ngaashi tashi monika momenyu yohangara yoshiigwana, olwoodhi lwa 0.6.1, okutala kwoshitopolwa shatatu pombunda.",
  "d.zemkuh": "Kala poshitaya shehala lyoshilwifo ndele u tse mo.",
  "d.zflx86": "Ombaliha yokaalaka ya hanganithwa moshiigwana",
  "d.zitf93": "Omaminigan gokuhondola momikalo ndatu: 3 000, 2 000 na 1 800 rpm pagan kehe ngele a hondola nawa (omuhoko gwa 20, 30 na 35 mm).",
  "d.zpe8n2": "Okutsa omaroketi pagan okwa pewa edhina CIWS, pokati nootenga.",
