  "economy.todayHead": "Shoka shi po nena",
  "economy.todayLead": "Omalongo golwoodhi nengala negala lyoLOADOUT nombala yengala (0.6.0) otaga ulike ontopolwa yomalongo nomaudhano ngoka oikonomi tayi hala okupa.",
  "faq.becauseRevenueMeant": "Oshoshi ookula dhasho dhi na okuya futa. Oshiigwana oshi tameke sha ningwa ayihe kAI opo shi vule okukala, ndele aaninga-ofana ya futwa otaa shuna po oilonga yAI, ya tumbulwa nedhina.",
  "faq.canIPlay": "Onda vulu okulonga mombaliha?",
  "faq.freePlay": "Otashi longwa ihe na ondhimbo?",
  "faq.n07Questions": "07 · Omapulo",
  "faq.notYetLan": "Aawe natango. Okulonga pamwe pomukanda gumwe gwe LAN otaku longo nena (okuza ko 0.2.0); okulonga mombaliha kuhe li po.",
  "faq.prototypeWasBuilt": "Efaneko lyotango olya ningwa penjini yoshiigwana Quake III Arena ya ulikwa kuupu (GPL), noshikepe yaElite Dangerous ngaashi omupondolo. Mosiku etiyali ooode yoshiigwana oya yi pa BuB, enjini epe ya shangwa na Claude Code; omamodule goshiigwana oga za kefaneko lyotango, nokonima oga tumbulwa lyo edhina epe. Efaneko 0.3.0 olya pa iikepe aveshe 16 olwoodhi lwawo epe. Ekonakono lyoluvalo lyelaisensa olya tala kutya ooode otaa kala oya za koshiigwana sha GPL, nutya iikepe yotango otayi yelekana noshipondolo. Okuyelekana kwooode nongushu ya GPL okwa ningwa mosiku <0/>, ndele ekonakono lyomaiyuvo gokuyelekana otali kalelwa. Shoka sha za koshiigwana otashi ka shangwa lyo nenge shi yelekwe lyo. Fiyo ekonakono tali hulithwa, katu tumbula kutya eyamukulo olo aawe.",
  "faq.questions": "Omapulo",
  "faq.shipsArtInterface": "Iikepe, omafano, okukwatha nosho yilwe, ngaashi ookula tadhi vula. <0>Ombuku mepandja eli<\/0> otayi tumbula oshitopolwa kehe notayi ulike okushuna po kwasho nomuninga-ofana gwasho.",
  "faq.shipsUpgradesPlanned": "Iikepe nomalongo oya pangelwa okumonwa mokulonga nenge okulandwa. Ngaashi iikepe ya futwa tayi kala ya yuka mokulwa kwaakuyuuvi yaaivali natango otaku pangelwa.",
  "faq.thatPlanFree": "Eyi oyo epangelo: okulonga ihe na ondhimbo nookula dhomoshiigwana nomaudhano ngoka a yambulwa. Kasha ningwa natango.",
  "faq.wasAnyoneS": "Oilonga yomuntu oya kopwa?",
  "faq.whenOutWhat": "Otayi pita ngapi, nopa shike?",
  "faq.whichPartsWill": "Iitopolwa yi ke aantu taa shuna po, notandi shi shi ngapi?",
  "faq.whyWouldAi": "Omolwashike oshiigwana sha ningwa kAI tashi kwatha aaninga-ofana?",
  "faq.willPayWin": "Otashi kala 'futa u vule'?",
  "faq.windowsPcThere": "Windows PC. Kape na esiku lyokupita nenge ondjabi natango.",
  "footer.anthropicClaudeClaude": "Anthropic, Claude na Claude Code oyo omaunonga ga Anthropic, PBC. Unreal Engine na Epic Games oyo omaunonga ga Epic Games, Inc. Blender oshiunonga shaBlender Foundation. Quake III Arena na Elite Dangerous oyo omaunonga gaamwene yago. Omadhina aveshe ogamwene yago, noga longithwa ashike opo ga tseyithe oikulya tayi tumbulwa. Orion-81 kaa na oshikwatho, etulomo nenge etaambulo lyomwe gwomuyo.",
  "footer.aspirationalNoPartnership": "Etalelo ashike. Kape na oshikwatho, etulomo nenge etaambulo.",
  "footer.channelComing": "Ekanala otali ya",
  "footer.devlogYoutube": "Devlog pa YouTube",
  "footer.followKickstarter": "Landula Kickstarter",
  "footer.futurePartners": "Aakwatelishi yomonakuyiwa?",
  "footer.noTrackersNo": "Kape na iitseyithi. Kape na omakuki. Ewebusait lyokutala. Oshinima kehe osha za meyandjo lyoshilongo; kape na shoka shi li mpaka sha pewa nenge sha tumbulwa.",
  "footer.notLiveYet": "Ita li po natango",
  "footer.oneItemStill": "Oshinima shimwe natango osha kala: <0>ekonakono lyelaisensa<\/0> lyooode yoshiigwana sha za kokuyelekwa kwa GPL. Okuyelekana kwooode nongushu yokuyelekwa okwa ningwa mosiku <1/>, ndele ekonakono lyomaiyuvo gokuyelekana otali kalelwa.",
  "footer.orion81Completely": "<0>Orion-81 oshilongo shi shi ya ningwa ayihe kAI.<\/0> Ooode yaOrion-81 yene na Claude Code, ya yelekwa komutameki; iikepe, iikarata, omatekisitura neendo ya ningwa kiilongitho ya shangwa kuClaude Code. Omabaliha gokaalaka ngoka ga longithwa oga tumbulwa pevi <1>'Ihe ya ningwa kAI'<\/1>.",
  "footer.siteFooterAriaLabel": "Eyoyo lyewebusait",
  "hero.behindThisPlate": "Konima yepleti eli: ekeepo lyomoshigwana lya ORION-1 okuza kefaneko 0.6.1, olya ulikwa pehala lyokonima mombrausa yoye (lya shunithwa kuwebusait, ekeepo lya ngoshithwa fiyo 512 px).",
